# ExtSentry Browser Extension Suricata Rules
# NOTE: Most browser extension traffic is HTTPS. These rules require TLS
# inspection/decryption to be effective, or will match on non-encrypted
# traffic only (e.g., update checks on some enterprise networks).
# Consider using Suricata datasets for better performance with large IOC lists.

